            "review_title": "Review at Nguyen Sinh",
            "review_text": "Maddie\n2 contributions\n0\nA traditional and classic restaurant. Simple but not ordinary. Very lovely place with a significant history in Hanoi.\nAug 2023 • Family\nAn adorable hole on the wall type of place with simple yet amazing meals. I just love their banh mi sandwith with pâté and veggie. The location is very convenience too, since it's near the Hoan Kiem lake and the French Quarter. They close rather early though, and a bit difficult to order online on weekends, or even approach due to the walking streets.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 4, 2023",
